        "Description": "Hello, 47. Diana here. Your next assignment is in Paris. You have three targets, all three will be at the opera house on Friday. The first is Portuguese tenor Alvaro D’ Alvade, who will be in the opera &quot;Tosca&quot;. His lifelong friend, American Ambassador Richard Delahunt will be attending the opera, along with a new friend of theirs Albert Fournier of the metro-politian police. All three targets must be eliminated. Good luck, 47 there&apos;s a lot of money on the line with this one. (Start in the attic)",
